{"id":"n85087-1-10","stage":3,"title":"향상 · 提高","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85087-1-10-1","ko":"옛날에는 해외로 가려면 한참 걸렸다던데.","zh":"听说以前要去国外的话，需要花很长时间呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옛날에는","meaning":"过去，昔日","explanation":"옛날：过去，昔日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57273","senseId":"2","lemma":"옛날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옛날에는","audio":"/audio/63b687d4877a77045bc5.mp3"}},{"text":"해외로","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외로","audio":"/audio/58d83a89f4f1698e3d9c.mp3"}},{"text":"가려면","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려면","audio":"/audio/fde17e82c40c3f9f5bb6.mp3"}},{"text":"한참","meaning":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","explanation":"한참：一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","readings":[{"term":"한참","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72463","senseId":"1","lemma":"한참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한참","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3"}},{"text":"걸렸다던데.","meaning":"花费，消耗","explanation":"걸리다：花费，消耗；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다던데：转述听到的情况，并留下确认、补充或对照的语气。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"21","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸렸다던데","audio":"/audio/d52dac0df340be637055.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"336963582ab921f0","term":"옛날","zh":"过去，昔日","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3","entryId":"57273","definition":"以前的某一时段。","pronunciation":["옌ː날"]},{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"去","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"7c9ab81e35e5793d","term":"한참","zh":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3","entryId":"72463","definition":"时间过了很久。","pronunciation":["한참"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"花费，消耗","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"需要消磨时间。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e8ead9154da5f6c73c84.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85087-1-10-2","ko":"이제는 기술 향상 덕분에 먼 나라까지도 금방 갈 수 있잖아.","zh":"现在多亏了技术进步，就算去很远的国度也能很快到达啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제는","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제는","audio":"/audio/f91d8bba6ccbcd8c5247.mp3"}},{"text":"기술","meaning":"技术","explanation":"기술：技术","readings":[{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73355","senseId":"1","lemma":"기술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}},{"text":"향상","meaning":"提高，进步，提升，进取，增加","explanation":"향상：提高，进步，提升，进取，增加","readings":[{"term":"향상","audio":"/audio/d78067dbf1618618082e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85087","senseId":"1","lemma":"향상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"향상","audio":"/audio/d78067dbf1618618082e.mp3"}},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덕분에","audio":"/audio/b018e6ffb125d6c10a69.mp3"}},{"text":"먼","meaning":"远","explanation":"멀다：远；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼","audio":"/audio/a0812217c2f5902295ca.mp3"}},{"text":"나라까지도","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라까지도","audio":"/audio/457c51e8019e67f744ab.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立马，很快","explanation":"금방：马上，立马，很快","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"4","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있잖아.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있잖아","audio":"/audio/9daaa7ad7fc1d3865a65.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"a78cee47656be418","term":"기술","zh":"技术","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3","entryId":"73355","definition":"将科学理论应用到实际中，使其对人类生活有用的手段。","pronunciation":["기술"]},{"id":"d78067dbf1618618","term":"향상","zh":"提高，进步，提升，进取，增加","audio":"/audio/d78067dbf1618618082e.mp3","entryId":"85087","definition":"实力、水平、技术等变得更好；或指使其变好。","pronunciation":["향ː상"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"远","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"两地之间的距离长。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立马，很快","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"所需时间非常短。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc9770d929a85f2a26d0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85087","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典",